Package: locate-anything-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: apiplant <releases@apiplant.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/locate-anything-rs
Description: Rust (candle) inference for nvidia/LocateAnything-3B visual grounding
 locate-anything detects, grounds, points at and reads text in images
 with nvidia/LocateAnything-3B (MoonViT + Qwen2.5 with Parallel Box
 Decoding), locally via candle. The model weights (about 7.6 GB) are
 downloaded from Hugging Face on first use into ~/.cache/locate-anything-
 rs, or taken from --model DIR.
